    "type": "question",
    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "[Parametrisation of a circle]\n\nIf $x=a\\cos\\theta$ and $y=a\\sin\\theta$, show that $x^2+y^2=a^2$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$x^2+y^2=a^2(\\cos^2\\theta+\\sin^2\\theta)=a^2$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2+y^2&=(a\\cos\\theta)^2+(a\\sin\\theta)^2\\\\&=a^2(\\cos^2\\theta+\\sin^2\\theta)\\\\&=a^2.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
